# Summary

The club charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The exact amount a member pays each year is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-d3e1295cd4cfa219798608f558eadadd182302e6 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The membership fee is therefore a yearly contribution, and the amount is specified in the annex. [[cite:obs-d3e1295cd4cfa219798608f558eadadd182302e6 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]
